      "text": "Attach plots against a 15% target line and\nactivation against a 70% benchmark. Plotting\nattach_rate_vs_target as a bar reads as on-plan\nonly to someone who already knows the plan.",
      "originalText": "Attach plots against a 15% target line and\nactivation against a 70% benchmark. Plotting\nattach_rate_vs_target as a bar reads as on-plan\nonly to someone who already knows the plan.",
