      "updated": 1786900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "30-day activation reads 71.1% across all matured\naccounts. The newest cohort reads 60.3% only\nbecause a quarter of it has not finished its\nwindow; leading with it reports censoring as\nperformance.",
      "originalText": "30-day activation reads 71.1% across all matured\naccounts. The newest cohort reads 60.3% only\nbecause a quarter of it has not finished its\nwindow; leading with it reports censoring as\nperformance.",
