      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The CS queue splits by driver as counts, because\nrisk_driver is assigned from the same flags that\ndefine at-risk \u2014 a rate there is 1.0 in every\nbucket by construction. The rate goes on the state\ncut.",
      "originalText": "The CS queue splits by driver as counts, because\nrisk_driver is assigned from the same flags that\ndefine at-risk \u2014 a rate there is 1.0 in every\nbucket by construction. The rate goes on the state\ncut.",
